[00:00.000 --> 00:04.680]  Lesson 2. If you went through lesson 1, you know how to open. You know how to make her feel
[00:04.680 --> 00:09.680]  noticed. Not hit on. You know how to build something from nothing. Now comes the harder part.
[00:10.040 --> 00:14.200]  Because once she's interested, or even before she's interested, she's going to test you.
[00:14.560 --> 00:19.020]  Not because she's mean. Not because she doesn't like you. Because that's how attraction works.
[00:19.540 --> 00:23.680]  Women test men instinctively. They push to see who they're dealing with. A man who
[00:23.680 --> 00:27.880]  breaks under the pressure, doesn't make her feel safe. A man who holds his ground does.
[00:27.880 --> 00:32.620]  What you're about to learn is frame. Five principles for holding your ground when things
[00:32.620 --> 00:38.080]  get uncomfortable. Most men never learn this. They bend. They over explain. They apologize for
